{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Handless Mage","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/handless-mage.webp","scaleX":3,"scaleY":3,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":3,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/handless-mage.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Handless Mage","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":145,"temp":0,"max":145,"details":"negative healing"},"ac":{"value":27,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"slashing","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"mental","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","draconic","dwarven","elven","fey","goblin","jotun","orcish"],"details":""},"level":{"value":9},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Although considered macabre by some, the creation of the <em>hand of the mage</em> magic item requires the use of a severed hand, generally sourced from a deceased arcane spellcaster. Sometimes, however, the dead aren't so content with being robbed, especially of a part of their body. When a handless mage rises from their grave, they won't rest until their corpse is returned to its original state.</p>\n<p>A handless mage is always paired with a specific <em>hand of the mage</em>, and since the handless mage rose from its grave only to return what was stolen, they spend their time searching endlessly for it in often futile attempts to recover it. Only after they've righted this wrong can a handless mage rest, gladly moving on to the afterlife.</p>\n<p>While some handless mages may resort to physical violence against those who hold their specific hand of the mage, others are more than content to trade what few goods or services they can offer for their missing extremity. Depending on the mage, they might consider parting with a magic staff or, in some rare cases, their old spell book.</p>\n<h2>Handy-dandy Trade</h2>\n<p>No small number of people have found success asking a handless mage to obtain another <em>hand of the mage</em> to trade for their own hand back.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 90/200/360 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), perception item, skill items (Arcana, Deception, Diplomacy, Survival)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> energy resistant (negative), evil, intelligence, mental, spells (Arcane: charitable urge, mage hand, phantom pain, telekinetic maneuver, telekinetic projectile), wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":3},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"proprioception","mod":18,"senses":[],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":20,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"arcana":{"base":20},"deception":{"base":18},"diplomacy":{"base":16},"survival":{"base":16}},"traits":{"value":["elf","evil","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/handless-mage.webp","items":[{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Proprioception","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A handless mage is under the effects of a constant <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.LQzlKbYjZSMFQawP]{Locate}</em> spell, targeting the handless mage's specific hand of the mage. In addition to this, any creature wearing their paired hand of the mage within line of sight of the handless mage is always observed by the handless mage, even if it's @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hiding}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Invisible]{Invisible}, or the like.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"SOcVVAV41Yglw5PY","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688680954695,"modifiedTime":1688680993155,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/adventuring-gear/spellbook.webp","name":"Spellbook","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A spellbook holds the written knowledge necessary to learn and prepare various spells, a necessity for wizards (who typically get one for free) and a useful luxury for other spellcasters looking to learn additional spells. Each spellbook can hold up to 100 spells. The Price listed is for a blank spellbook.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"spellbook-blank","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":1}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null,"handsHeld":0},"containerId":null,"size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Book","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/adventuring_gear.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"subitems":[]},"type":"equipment","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681001078,"modifiedTime":1688681016405,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.FOWF5f0tCaApv9RE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"pV82d3hghq5yuPcy"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Fear of the Cut","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The handless mage was formed when a corpse was desecrated with a blade, and thus they have an intense revulsion to being cut. Whenever a handless mage takes slashing damage, they also become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1}, or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} if they take slashing damage from a critical hit.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Y8iovPg3FYZvIrRN","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681090756,"modifiedTime":1688681134066,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Now You Know How I Feel","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 60 feet of the handless mage performs an action with the manipulate trait</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The handless mage points their residual limb at the triggering creature, forcing it to make a @Check[type:will|dc:30] save. On a failure, the triggering action is disrupted.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"nE2VrI23BzBKu2Ht","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681136371,"modifiedTime":1688681165091,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Rejuvenation","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>As long as their hand of the mage remains intact, a handless mage can't be truly slain. If killed, the handless mage rises [[/br 1d6+1 #Days]]] days later, even if their body is destroyed. Only after the handless mage retrieves their hand of the mage and possesses it for a full year does the spirit move on, reducing the magic item to a mundane hand in the process.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"C8px62uDwKj1DlnB","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681169577,"modifiedTime":1688681209850,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fist","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"X9vvRCd4ckVuCDNH":{"damage":"2d8+7","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"LKCcd5jgf4JeBCjV","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681217514,"modifiedTime":1688681241154,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"name":"Arcane Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":20,"dc":30},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681246524,"modifiedTime":1688681432698,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/phantom-pain.webp","name":"Phantom Pain","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Illusory pain wracks the target, dealing 2d4 mental damage and 1d4 persistent mental damage. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full initial damage but no persistent damage, and the spell ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full initial and persistent damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. If the target recovers from being Sickened, the persistent damage ends and the spell ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 and the persistent damage by 1d4.</p>\n<p>[[/r (@item.level)d4[persistent,mental]]]{Leveled Persistent Mental Damage}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"phantom-pain","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"formula":"2d4","type":"mental","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l","heightenedLevel":5,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"2d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681417534,"modifiedTime":1688681437075,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R8bqnYiThB6MYTxD","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"YcxuKmozay1ykQkE"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/charitable-urge.webp","name":"Charitable Urge","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You speak on the virtue of charity, compelling the target to give away its possessions. The target must attempt a Will save. If the target has no items on its person, the spell fails.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} as it wrestles with the urge.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> On its next turn, before it does anything else, the target must present the nearest creature with an item in its possession; the target chooses which item to give, and if the only item it has is one that it's currently using to defend itself, such as a weapon during a combat encounter, it can choose to be Stunned for 1 round instead of giving up the item. This might require the target to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.pvQ5rY2zrtPI614F]{Interact} to retrieve an item or move to reach the nearest creature, and handing the item to the target always requires an Interact action.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the duration is 4 rounds, and the target must repeat the effects of failure on each of its turns. At the end of each of its turns, the target can attempt a new Will save to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, ending it entirely on a critical success.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"charitable-urge","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Advanced Player's Guide","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681422443,"modifiedTime":1688681422443,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.UirEIHILQgip87qv","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"D5cjpaRZ6WXQaypR"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/telekinetic-maneuver.webp","name":"Telekinetic Maneuver","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>With a rush of telekinetic power, you move a foe or something they carry. You can attempt to Disarm, Shove, or Trip the target using a spell attack roll instead of an Athletics check.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-maneuver","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","concentrate","force","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681424237,"modifiedTime":1688681424237,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.mrDi3v933gsmnw25","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"CbbcUQfDwAeUjw2Q"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/telekinetic-projectile.webp","name":"Telekinetic Projectile","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage-as appropriate for the object you hurled-equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-projectile","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"1d6","type":"untyped","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"overlays":{"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA":{"_id":"2I469pfbYcmFvzOA","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Bludgeoning)","overlayType":"override","sort":1,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"bludgeoning"}}}},"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF":{"_id":"cUFX7ExSLeoa3vIF","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Piercing)","overlayType":"override","sort":2,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"piercing"}}}},"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV":{"_id":"zFWsMjoeCnLxqJaV","name":"Telekinetic Projectile (Slashing)","overlayType":"override","sort":3,"system":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"slashing"}}}}}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681425758,"modifiedTime":1688681425758,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.60sgbuMWN0268dB7","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"WJ306CseLYuqVEyh"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mage-hand.webp","name":"Mage Hand","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a single magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and moves it slowly up to 20 feet. Because you're levitating the object, you can move it in any direction. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mage-hand","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 unattended object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681427500,"modifiedTime":1688681427500,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"QdPeOryGNzn096hP"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/locate.webp","name":"Locate (Constant, Linked Hand of the Mage Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You learn the direction to the target (if you picked a specific object, such as \"my mother's sword\") or the nearest target (if you picked a type of object, such as \"swords\"). If the target is a specific object, you must have observed it directly with your own senses. If it's a type of object, you still need to have an accurate mental image of the type of object. If there's lead or running water between you and the target, this spell can't locate the object. This means you might find a type of object farther away if the nearest one is behind lead or running water.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target a specific creature or ancestry instead of an object, but you must have met or seen up close the creature or ancestry you want to target.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"locate","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 specific object or type of object"},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"TFm3Inc9yuE1hc8l","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"1 specific object or type of object, or a specific creature or ancestry"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681448047,"modifiedTime":1688681484184,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.LQzlKbYjZSMFQawP","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"bNneQILbG59md011"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688681492286,"modifiedTime":1688681492286,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kakyXBG5WA8c6Zfd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"fuSgdvELZErqSaGC"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Phantom Limb Pain","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The handless mage sweeps their residual limb in an arc, assailing the minds of every creature in the area. The handless mage deals @Damage[8d6[mental]] damage to each creature in a @Template[type:cone|distance:30] with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:28] save. Regardless of the result, they are temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage, becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 2} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, plus the creature Releases what it's holding in one of its hands (the handless mage's choice).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","illusion","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"tmrWHrzNYoWUlRLQ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","co